Package: tripwire
Title: Catch Silent Failures in Data-Analysis Steps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jay", "Clark", email = "27960665+JsizzleR@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight, dependency-free checks that flag when a data
    operation quietly goes wrong -- a join that drops or multiplies rows,
    a key mismatch, surprising missingness -- and return a structured,
    auditable verdict suitable for surfacing in a user-facing "health
    strip".
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
